01:37:13.530 --> 01:37:16.466 line:78%
OFFICER AND WHOM THE EXECUTIVE

01:37:14.464 --> 01:37:19.436 line:78%
POWERS RESTED.

01:37:16.567 --> 01:37:20.470 line:78%
THERE IS NO PHILOSOPHY THAT

01:37:19.536 --> 01:37:22.439 line:78%
WOULD SUPPORT A FINDING OF

01:37:20.571 --> 01:37:24.474 line:78%
JUSTICIABILITY ON THE GROUNDS

01:37:22.539 --> 01:37:25.442 line:78%
THAT WERE STRENGTHENING THE

01:37:24.575 --> 01:37:27.444 line:78%
DEMOCRATIC PROCESS, AS WAS TRUE

01:37:25.542 --> 01:37:29.413 line:78%
IN POWELL AND ALSO INTO A

01:37:27.544 --> 01:37:33.517 line:78%
GREATER EXTENT IN BAKER AND

01:37:29.513 --> 01:37:34.551 line:78%
CARR.

