AND, THAT CAN'T BE

01:38:25.168 --> 01:38:29.172 line:78%
CONSTITUTIONAL.

01:38:28.272 --> 01:38:32.175 line:78%
THE FRAMERS OF THE CONSTITUTION

01:38:29.273 --> 01:38:34.177 line:78%
HAD IN MIND A STRONG PRESIDENCY.

