WAS UNDER IMPEACHMENT SHOULD BE

01:39:14.751 --> 01:39:17.654 line:78%
SUSPENDED DURING THE PENDENCY OF

01:39:15.752 --> 01:39:19.690 line:78%
THE IMPEACHMENT PROCEEDINGS.

01:39:17.754 --> 01:39:21.692 line:78%
AND, THE DECISION WAS DEFINITELY

01:39:19.790 --> 01:39:24.695 line:78%
HE SHOULD NOT BECAUSE THE

01:39:21.792 --> 01:39:26.663 line:78%
FRAMERS ENVISIONED A STRONG

