01:40:12.309 --> 01:40:15.212 line:78%
COURT IN A POLITICAL MATTER.

01:40:14.311 --> 01:40:17.247 line:78%
NOW, MERE FACT THAT POLITICS IS

01:40:15.312 --> 01:40:18.248 line:78%
INVOLVE, OF COURSE, HAS NOT

01:40:17.347 --> 01:40:20.317 line:78%
PREVENTED THE COURT FROM TAKING

01:40:18.348 --> 01:40:21.318 line:78%
