01:40:32.496 --> 01:40:37.467 line:78%
THEREFORE, THE JUSTIFICATION

01:40:34.498 --> 01:40:38.435 line:78%
BETWEEN BAKER AND CARR AND IN

01:40:37.567 --> 01:40:41.471 line:78%
THE POWELL CASE IS NOT AVAILABLE

01:40:38.535 --> 01:40:42.506 line:78%
OR IS NOT APPLICABLE HERE.

01:40:41.571 --> 01:40:44.574 line:78%
FURTHERMORE, HOWEVER, THE

01:40:42.606 --> 01:40:46.643 line:78%
ARGUMENT STILL, IN MY VIEW, HAS

01:40:44.674 --> 01:40:49.646 line:78%
FORCE WITH RESPECT TO THE

01:40:46.743 --> 01:40:50.680 line:78%
CONSEQUENCES OF THE GRAND JURY

01:40:49.746 --> 01:40:51.681 line:78%
