01:40:50.781 --> 01:40:55.819 line:78%
CO-CONSPIRATOR WHICH WE SUGGEST

01:40:51.782 --> 01:40:56.520 line:78%
THEY WERE NOT QUALIFIED TO DO.

01:40:55.919 --> 01:41:01.691 line:78%
THE PRESIDENT IS NOT ABOVE THE

