01:41:03.827 --> 01:41:08.899 line:78%
A CONSTITUTIONAL WAY WHICH IS

01:41:05.929 --> 01:41:10.901 line:78%
DIFFERENT THAN ANYONE ELSE.

01:41:08.999 --> 01:41:13.904 line:78%
NAMELY, WE SUGGEST THAT HE CAN

01:41:11.001 --> 01:41:15.906 line:78%
