EFFECT OF DIMINISHING THE

01:41:33.290 --> 01:41:36.092 line:78%
PRESIDENT'S RIGHTS, IT'S A PRO

01:41:34.224 --> 01:41:38.161 line:78%
TANTO, IF I MAY SAY SO,

01:41:36.193 --> 01:41:39.162 line:78%
IMPEACHMENT.

01:41:38.261 --> 01:41:40.163 line:78%
&gt;&gt; I SHOULD THINK YOU COULD RUN

