01:42:33.683 --> 01:42:37.587 line:78%
HIS OFFICE TO PROTECT THE

01:42:36.720 --> 01:42:39.623 line:78%
PRESIDENCY FROM UNWARRANTED

01:42:37.687 --> 01:42:41.658 line:78%
