01:43:21.831 --> 01:43:24.768 line:78%
QUESTION OF THE NECESSITY SHOWN

01:43:23.833 --> 01:43:28.738 line:78%
FOR THIS BECAUSE, EVEN ON HIS

01:43:24.868 --> 01:43:29.706 line:78%
