01:43:29.806 --> 01:43:33.843 line:78%
SOME NECESSITY.

01:43:32.943 --> 01:43:34.811 line:78%
NOW WE SHOULD UNDERSTAND, I'M

01:43:33.944 --> 01:43:36.813 line:78%
SURE THE COURT KNOWS, THAT ALL

01:43:34.911 --> 01:43:39.883 line:78%
OF THESE INDIVIDUALS HERE

01:43:36.913 --> 01:43:42.953 line:78%
INVOLVED HAVE TESTIFIED BEFORE

